---
permalink: /en/tour/precios/
title: "Pricing & booking"
description: "Palomino Islands tour pricing for residents (from S/. 179) and visitors (from US$69). No online payment — everything by WhatsApp."
---
{% set t = i18n[lang] %}
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>›</span><a href="/en/tour/">The Tour</a><span>›</span> Pricing</nav>
    <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:var(--space-4)">Pricing</p>
    <h1>Transparent pricing, no surprises</h1>
    <p class="lead">Rates for residents in Peru and for international visitors. The SERNANP fee is paid separately.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container" data-price-tabs>
    <div class="price-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Rate type">
      <button role="tab" id="tab-res" aria-controls="panel-res" aria-selected="true">Residents (S/)</button>
      <button role="tab" id="tab-ext" aria-controls="panel-ext" aria-selected="false">Visitors (US$)</button>
    </div>
    <div role="tabpanel" id="panel-res" aria-labelledby="tab-res">
      <table class="price-table tnum"><tbody>
        {% for row in site.pricing.residents %}<tr><td>{{ row.who_en }}{% if row.note_en %} <small>({{ row.note_en }})</small>{% endif %}</td><td>{{ row.price or row.price_en }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody></table>
      <p class="price-note">{{ site.pricing.extra_en }}</p>
    </div>
    <div role="tabpanel" id="panel-ext" aria-labelledby="tab-ext" hidden>
      <table class="price-table tnum"><tbody>
        {% for row in site.pricing.foreigners %}<tr><td>{{ row.who_en }}{% if row.note_en %} <small>({{ row.note_en }})</small>{% endif %}</td><td>{{ row.price }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
      </tbody></table>
      <p class="price-note">{{ site.pricing.extra_en }}</p>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:var(--space-3);color:var(--text-secondary)">We arrange availability and payment via WhatsApp.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">How to book</p>
    <h2>Your booking in 4 steps</h2>
    <div class="steps" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <div class="step"><strong>Message us</strong><p>Tell us your date and group size on WhatsApp.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><strong>We confirm</strong><p>We confirm availability and payment details.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><strong>Passenger details</strong><p>You send names, ages, IDs and nationalities.</p></div>
      <div class="step"><strong>Done!</strong><p>After payment we send the boarding address.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="media-split">
      <div class="media-split__media">
        <img src="/assets/img/galeria/g11.jpg" alt="Guest enjoying the Palomino Islands voyage">
        <span class="media-split__badge">Book with confidence</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Before you book</p>
        <h2>Booking &amp; payment policies</h2>
        <p class="lead">Everything you need to know to book your voyage with peace of mind and no surprises.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid cols-2" style="margin-top:var(--space-8)">
      <div class="card card--top"><div class="card__body">
        <span class="icon-chip">{{ icon("reservas") }}</span>
        <h3>Bookings</h3>
        <ul style="padding-left:var(--space-6);margin:0">
          <li>Send your request via WhatsApp or to <a href="mailto:reservas@ecocruceros.com">reservas@ecocruceros.com</a>.</li>
          <li>Include each passenger's name, age, ID number and nationality.</li>
          <li>We recommend checking availability before booking.</li>
          <li>Private services are best booked in advance.</li>
          <li><strong>Groups:</strong> one free passenger from 15 passengers onward.</li>
        </ul>
      </div></div>
      <div class="card card--top"><div class="card__body">
        <span class="icon-chip">{{ icon("pagos") }}</span>
        <h3>Payments</h3>
        <ul style="padding-left:var(--space-6);margin:0">
          <li>The service is paid in <strong>full (100%)</strong>, at the latest <strong>24 hours before</strong> departure.</li>
          <li>Email us the payment receipt.</li>
          <li>No online payments are made through this website.</li>
        </ul>
      </div></div>
      <div class="card card--top"><div class="card__body">
        <span class="icon-chip">{{ icon("traslados") }}</span>
        <h3>Service & transfers</h3>
        <ul style="padding-left:var(--space-6);margin:0">
          <li>The waiting time to pick up passengers is <strong>15 minutes</strong>. If we cannot reach you, it will be treated as a <strong>NO SHOW</strong> and a proportional charge will apply.</li>
          <li>Check your belongings before the service ends: the company is not responsible for personal items left behind.</li>
          <li>Pickup from other districts (San Borja, Barranco, La Molina, etc.) carries an additional charge. Please ask in advance.</li>
        </ul>
      </div></div>
      <div class="card card--top-gold"><div class="card__body">
        <span class="icon-chip icon-chip--gold">{{ icon("anulaciones") }}</span>
        <h3>Cancellations</h3>
        <ul style="padding-left:var(--space-6);margin:0">
          <li>You may cancel your booking up to <strong>24 hours before</strong> the service starts.</li>
          <li>After that window, the booking is treated as a <strong>no show</strong>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
